<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white">The depreciation expense
related to property and equipment, net for the years ended December 2024, 2023 and 2022 was included in the Company&#8217;s consolidated
statements of comprehensive loss, excluding discontinued operations in the amount of USD <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AccumulatedDepreciationDepletionAndAmortizationPropertyPlantAndEquipmentPeriodIncreaseDecrease" scale="3" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-19927">0</ix:nonFraction> thousand, USD <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c6" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AccumulatedDepreciationDepletionAndAmortizationPropertyPlantAndEquipmentPeriodIncreaseDecrease" scale="3" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-19928">51</ix:nonFraction> thousand and USD <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c7" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AccumulatedDepreciationDepletionAndAmortizationPropertyPlantAndEquipmentPeriodIncreaseDecrease" scale="3" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-19929">453</ix:nonFraction> thousand,
respectively.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white">&#160;</p>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" escape="true" name="srt:CondensedStatementOfComprehensiveIncomeTableTextBlock" id="ixv-15613"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white">Additionally, during
the year, the Company sold fixed assets for total consideration of USD <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromSaleOfIntangibleAssets" scale="3" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-19930">32</ix:nonFraction> thousand with a net book value of USD <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="stkh:FixedAssetsNetBookValue" scale="3" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-19931">55</ix:nonFraction> thousand.</p>
<p style="margin: 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></p>

