<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">Cash
payments related to operating lease liabilities for the years ended December 31, 2024, 2023, and 2022, were USD <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeasePayments" scale="3" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-19965">641</ix:nonFraction> thousand, USD <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c6" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeasePayments" scale="3" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-19966">620</ix:nonFraction>
thousand and USD <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c7" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeasePayments" scale="3" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-19967">604</ix:nonFraction> thousand, respectively.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></p>

