<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The weighted-average grant-date fair value of
RSUs and options granted during the years 2024, 2023 and 2022 was USD <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardOptionsVestedWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" unitRef="usdPershares" id="ixv-20138">0.04</ix:nonFraction>, USD <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c6" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardOptionsVestedWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" unitRef="usdPershares" id="ixv-20139">0.08</ix:nonFraction> and USD <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c7" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardOptionsVestedWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" unitRef="usdPershares" id="ixv-20140">0.24</ix:nonFraction> per ordinary share, or $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriodIntrinsicValue" scale="0" unitRef="usdPershares" id="ixv-20141">4.00</ix:nonFraction>, $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c6" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriodIntrinsicValue" scale="0" unitRef="usdPershares" id="ixv-20142">8.00</ix:nonFraction>
and $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c7" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriodIntrinsicValue" scale="0" unitRef="usdPershares" id="ixv-20143">24.00</ix:nonFraction> per ADS, respectively.</p>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">The
total intrinsic value of options exercised during the years ended December 31, 2024, 2023 and 2022, was USD <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c139" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="stkh:TotalIntrinsicValueOfOptionsExercised" scale="3" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-20144">0</ix:nonFraction>, USD <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c140" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="stkh:TotalIntrinsicValueOfOptionsExercised" scale="3" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-20145">0</ix:nonFraction> thousand and USD
<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c141" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="stkh:TotalIntrinsicValueOfOptionsExercised" scale="3" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-20146">246</ix:nonFraction> thousand, respectively.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><b>&#160;</b></span></p>

